约 #干货都在这","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671108785515121947","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671108785515121947","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-c8c10b552cb54e368949e601a733d736:11","title":"客户旅程-项目下单使用说明-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/132080","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/132080","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-c8c10b552cb54e368949e601a733d736:12","title":"【星图保底+佣金任务】服务商入驻+操作指南-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/facilitator/145088","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/facilitator/145088","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-c8c10b552cb54e368949e601a733d736:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-c8c10b552cb54e368949e601a733d736:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-c8c10b552cb54e368949e601a733d736:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-c8c10b552cb54e368949e601a733d736:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","question_text":"有没有批量邀约达人的工具？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":21,"valid_url_cards":16,"unique_url_events":16,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"328eb3e8355668b2f7266f4bd20ff011a58f201f610dac47448113a0d67114a8","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 有，分【官方合规工具】和【第三方自动化工具（有风险）】\n> 重点提醒：**浏览器插件/RPA自动批量发私信、自动采集达人联系方式属于平台违规行为**，轻则限制精选联盟邀约、私信封禁，重则店铺/账号直接封号，还有法律风险（非法抓取个人信息）\n\n## 一、官方合规批量邀约（优先推荐，安全）\n### 1. 抖店精选联盟（抖音带货）\n精选联盟达人广场，**可以筛选达人，批量勾选发送带货邀约**，但平台有每日邀约上限，不是无限发；适合中小商家免费使用，完全合规。\n\n### 2. 巨量星图（品牌商单）\n1. 星图【招募任务】：发布任务，达人主动报名，支持**批量圈选达人、批量指派任务**，可导入达人ID批量邀约，一次最多导入500个达人ID，官方原生功能，安全\n2. 达人清单功能：把筛选好的达人加入清单，后续批量发起合作邀约\n\n### 3. 团长模式（间接批量）\n找抖音招商团长，团长手里有大量达人资源，团长帮你批量对接达人，你只需要提供产品佣金/样品，商家不用自己手动邀约。\n\n## 二、第三方批量邀约工具（风险高，谨慎）\n这类大多是Chrome浏览器插件、RPA自动化工具：达人连连、小青苔、哈士奇邀约、TkTools（TikTok）等。\n功能：\n- 批量筛选达人、自动循环发送精选联盟邀约\n- 自动跳过已邀约达人，支持导入达人UID批量发起\n- 部分附带达人数据采集、导出联系方式\n\n⚠️ 风险一定要看：\n1. 违反抖音用户协议：自动化模拟人工操作、爬虫抓取达人信息，平台风控会检测，**店铺主号不建议使用**\n2. 账号处罚：限制达人邀约权限、私信封禁、店铺扣分，严重直接封店\n3. 隐私法律风险：自动抓取达人微信/手机号，涉嫌非法获取公民个人信息，有刑事判例\n4. 工具不稳定：平台后台一更新，插件直接失效，很多是按年/卡密收费\n\n## 三、替代低成本合规方案（不想踩坑推荐）\n1. 精选联盟筛选达人 → **导出达人清单**，人工分批次邀约，控制每日邀约量，话术做个性化修改，不要一模一样群发\n2. 巨量星图发布招募任务，达人主动报名，被动收达人，不需要主动群发\n3. 达人CRM管理工具（只做**达人资料管理、跟进记录**，**不带自动发私信/邀约**）：ScoreHub等，用来管理达人库，手动建联\n\n## 简单总结\n- 求稳、做长期店铺：**只用精选联盟+巨量星图官方批量功能**\n- 第三方自动邀约插件：效率高但**封号风险很大，不建议主店铺使用**\n- 绝对不要用工具自动扒达人微信手机号、批量私信引流到站外\n\n\n\n你主要是做抖音精选联盟带货，还是星图商单？我可以告诉你对应官方批量邀约的操作入口。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-e182c297364e4673900bf6d9f5119f04:1","title":"TkTools","raw_url":"http://tktools.bjkcyy.cn/","normalized_url":"http://tktools.bjkcyy.cn/","host":"tktools.bjkcyy.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-e182c297364e4673900bf6d9f5119f04:2","title":"达人连连","raw_url":"https://www.dcjling.com/","normalized_url":"https://www.dcjling.com/","host":"www.dcjling.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-e182c297364e4673900bf6d9f5119f04:3","title":"2025一键邀约达人软件有哪些？一键邀约达人插件哪个好用？一键邀约达人软件多少钱？#一键邀约达人 #达人软件 #批量邀约达人 #电商运营","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7563186622398696714","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7563186622398696714","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-e182c297364e4673900bf6d9f5119f04:4","title":"展会现场实测！ScoreHub 🆓免费达人邀约，500万达人库直接用✅","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7611803333921498594","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7611803333921498594","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","question_id":"CQ-Q0149","citation_id":"smp-e182c297364e4673900bf6d9f5119f04:5","title":"抖音招募任务-一口价模式-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/126583","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/126583","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0149","